From 71689e4a5ffda0892ef0c852516befafd31b4bfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "billding.df" <billding.df@alibaba-inc.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:40:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Revert "feat(build): add initial T-head SAIL platform
 support"

This reverts commit a952ddce23f26849e12de0d0fff4ea2893b3765e.

The hgcc/sailify-based SAIL build stack (sailify JIT conversion,
setup_sail.py AOT build, common_extension_sail.cc, SGLANG_SAIL_GPU_ARCH,
srt_sail extras) is dropped in favor of a CUDA-compatible SAIL platform
following the upstream PPU platform pattern (commit 8f8c2968cf13 of the
reference tree).

The SAIL platform detection layer (platforms/sail.py, PlatformEnum.SAIL,
is_sail()/is_sail_runtime()) is intentionally kept: ~26 downstream
commits depend on it. A follow-up commit re-lands the CUDA-compatible
pieces (JIT arch-suffix hook, tests).
